actual_result: "Re-verified main 7b1535434fe9: delivery bdace4efe731 is an ancestor. index.ts shares native importer arguments, flags and execution with csv-import; test/legacy-import-cli.test.ts checks real file operands, flags, dry-run and failures without git; test/commands.test.ts checks partial-error propagation."
