  "2026-10-20T13:57:54.339Z",codex-agent,"Review round complete for PR #174, thread PRRT_kwDOSYpI8s6uUtZt. The valid finding is fixed at the shared handler boundary: row mutation errors throw CommandError exit 1 with error count, imported/updated/skipped/filtered counts and every row diagnostic, covering native, legacy, configured and streaming imports. Final npm run release:check with isolated HOME, GIT_CONFIG_GLOBAL=/dev/null and GIT_CONFIG_NOSYSTEM=1 passed 287/287; bun run release:check in a byte-identical independent checkout passed 287/287. Both have zero fail/skip/cancel/todo, 100/100/100 configured coverage across all 3 required source files, 3/3 packed acceptance scenarios, zero production vulnerabilities and all other release checks passing. Linked pm tests passed 2/2; earlier timeouts passed on retry as recorded above. Guard-only revert failed 0/1; restoring the fix passed. The first full run exposed an obsolete success assertion, which was corrected and fully rerun. Rebuilt ignored dist; no dependency pin or coverage threshold changed. PM validation is ok with existing metadata/trust warnings. No new pm CLI/SDK bug was encountered; the existing extension/host skew remains tracked by pm-csv-sdyz. Whole-PR self-review found no additional defect instance. Leave the item in progress and release its claim for orchestrator review. No thread replies/resolutions, merge or release."
